; The one variable: text_overrun_behavior = 3 (OVERRUN_TRIM_ELLIPSIS) on a box narrower than its label.
; Button, CheckBox, CheckButton, OptionButton and MenuButton draw their label through Button::_notification,
; so TextParagraph::draw trims it to the paragraph box (button.cpp:428-432, text_paragraph.cpp:286-293)
; and the trimming overrun zeroes the text's width in the minimum size (button.cpp:493-495).

